---
// Japanese Footer Component
---

<footer class="border-t border-zinc-200/80 dark:border-zinc-800 py-12 sm:py-16 bg-white dark:bg-black text-[13px] sm:text-sm text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 transition-colors">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <!-- Top Brand & Scientific Foundation Row -->
    <div class="pb-10 mb-10 border-b border-zinc-200/80 dark:border-zinc-800/80 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center justify-between gap-6">
      <div class="max-w-xl">
        <a href="/ja" class="flex items-center gap-2.5 mb-2.5 group transition-opacity duration-200 hover:opacity-90 active:scale-[0.98]" aria-label="FreeIQExam 日本語トップページ">
          <svg class="w-7 h-7 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
            <circle cx="16" cy="9.5" r="5.5" class="fill-blue-600 dark:fill-blue-500" />
            <circle cx="8" cy="23" r="4.8" class="fill-blue-700 dark:fill-blue-600" />
            <circle cx="24" cy="23" r="4.8" class="fill-sky-400 dark:fill-sky-400" />
          </svg>
          <span class="font-heading font-extrabold text-lg tracking-tight text-zinc-950 dark:text-white">
            Free<span class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400">IQ</span>Exam
          </span>
        </a>
        <p class="text-[13px] sm:text-sm text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
          2PL項目反応理論（IRT）に基づく認知能力測定および感覚・反射機能の定量的ベンチマーク。登録不要・完全無料で即座に結果と分析レポートを確認できます。
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2.5 shrink-0 text-[13px]">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-950/60 border border-blue-200/60 dark:border-blue-900/40 text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-300 font-medium">
          <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-600 dark:bg-blue-400 animate-pulse"></span>
          2PL IRT 統計キャリブレーション
        </span>
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800/80 border border-zinc-200/80 dark:border-zinc-700/80 text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300 font-medium">
          完全無料・登録不要
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 4 Structured Semantic Columns -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8 mb-12">
      
      <!-- Column 1: 知能・メンタルヘルス診断 -->
      <div>
        <h4 class="font-heading font-bold text-[13px] uppercase tracking-wider text-zinc-950 dark:text-zinc-200 mb-3.5 flex items-center gap-2">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 shrink-0 text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" />
            <path d="M12 8v8M8 12h8" />
          </svg>
          <span>知能・メンタルヘルス</span>
        </h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-[13px] sm:text-sm">
          <li><a href="/ja/iq-test" class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 hover:text-[#0066cc] dark:hover:text-[#2997ff] transition-colors">無料IQテスト（24問）</a></li>
          <li><a href="/ja/mensa-test" class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 hover:text-[#0066cc] dark:hover:text-[#2997ff] transition-colors">メンサ向け練習テスト</a></li>
          <li><a href="/ja/adhd-test" class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 hover:text-[#0066cc] dark:hover:text-[#2997ff] transition-colors">成人期ADHDテスト (ASRS)</a></li>
          <li><a href="/ja/autism-test" class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 hover:text-[#0066cc] dark:hover:text-[#2997ff] transition-colors">自閉症スペクトラム (AQ-10)</a></li>
          <li><a href="/ja/depression-test" class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 hover:text-[#0066cc] dark:hover:text-[#2997ff] transition-colors">うつ病自己診断 (PHQ-9)</a></li>
          <li><a href="/ja/memento-mori" class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 hover:text-[#0066cc] dark:hover:text-[#2997ff] transition-colors">メメント・モリ人生カレンダー</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Column 2: 速度・感覚・ゲーミング -->
      <div>
        <h4 class="font-heading font-bold text-[13px] uppercase tracking-wider text-zinc-950 dark:text-zinc-200 mb-3.5 flex items-center gap-2">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 shrink-0 text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <rect x="2" y="6" width="20" height="12" rx="6" />
            <path d="M6 12h4m-2-2v4m10-2h.01M14 10h.01" />
          </svg>
          <span>速度・感覚・ゲーミング</span>
        </h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-[13px] sm:text-sm">
          <li><a href="/ja/reflex-test" class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 hover:text-[#0066cc] dark:hover:text-[#2997ff] transition-colors">反射神経テスト（反応速度）</a></li>
          <li><a href="/ja/cps-test" class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 hover:text-[#0066cc] dark:hover:text-[#2997ff] transition-colors">CPSテスト（クリック連打速度）</a></li>
          <li><a href="/ja/typing-test" class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 hover:text-[#0066cc] dark:hover:text-[#2997ff] transition-colors">タイピング練習・測定</a></li>
          <li><a href="/ja/color-blind-test" class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 hover:text-[#0066cc] dark:hover:text-[#2997ff] transition-colors">色覚テスト（擬似等色表）</a></li>
          <li><a href="/ja/flag-quiz" class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 hover:text-[#0066cc] dark:hover:text-[#2997ff] transition-colors">世界195カ国 国旗クイズ</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Column 3: 生体・ウェルネスツール -->
      <div>
        <h4 class="font-heading font-bold text-[13px] uppercase tracking-wider text-zinc-950 dark:text-zinc-200 mb-3.5 flex items-center gap-2">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 shrink-0 text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <rect x="4" y="2" width="16" height="20" rx="2" />
            <path d="M8 6h8M8 11h.01M12 11h.01M16 11h.01M8 15h.01M12 15h.01M16 15h.01M8 19h.01M12 19h.01M16 19h.01" />
          </svg>
          <span>生体・ウェルネス</span>
        </h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-[13px] sm:text-sm">
          <li><a href="/ja/calorie-calculator" class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 hover:text-[#0066cc] dark:hover:text-[#2997ff] transition-colors">カロリー計算（BMR・TDEE）</a></li>
          <li><a href="/ja/white-noise" class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 hover:text-[#0066cc] dark:hover:text-[#2997ff] transition-colors">ホワイトノイズ発生器</a></li>
          <li><a href="/ja/hearing-test" class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 hover:text-[#0066cc] dark:hover:text-[#2997ff] transition-colors">聴力・耳年齢テスト</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Column 4: 科学的根拠・免責事項 -->
      <div>
        <h4 class="font-heading font-bold text-[13px] uppercase tracking-wider text-zinc-950 dark:text-zinc-200 mb-3.5 flex items-center gap-2">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 shrink-0 text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M6 18h8" />
            <path d="M3 22h18" />
            <path d="M14 22a7 7 0 1 0-7-7h1" />
            <path d="M9 14h2" />
            <path d="M9 12a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6h6v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2Z" />
            <path d="M12 6V3a1 1 0 0 0-1-1H9a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v3" />
          </svg>
          <span>科学的根拠とポリシー</span>
        </h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-[13px] sm:text-sm">
          <li><a href="/ja" class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 hover:text-[#0066cc] dark:hover:text-[#2997ff] transition-colors">日本語ハブ</a></li>
          <li><a href="/privacy" class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 hover:text-[#0066cc] dark:hover:text-[#2997ff] transition-colors">プライバシーポリシー</a></li>
          <li><a href="/terms" class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 hover:text-[#0066cc] dark:hover:text-[#2997ff] transition-colors">利用規約</a></li>
          <li><a href="/methodology" class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 hover:text-[#0066cc] dark:hover:text-[#2997ff] transition-colors">測定メソドロジー</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Bottom Legal Bar -->
    <div class="pt-6 border-t border-zinc-200/80 dark:border-zinc-800/80 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-[13px]">
      <p class="text-[13px] text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400">
        &copy; 2026 FreeIQExam.com. All rights reserved. 教育および自己スクリーニング目的のみ。
      </p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-[13px] text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400">
        <a href="/privacy" class="hover:text-zinc-950 dark:hover:text-white transition-colors">プライバシー</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">&bull;</span>
        <a href="/terms" class="hover:text-zinc-950 dark:hover:text-white transition-colors">利用規約</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">&bull;</span>
        <a href="/methodology" class="hover:text-zinc-950 dark:hover:text-white transition-colors">科学的根拠</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
